# Google Maps Platform API Key
# To enable live interactive Google Maps and Places search for Jan Aushadhi Kendras:
# 1. Create a Google Cloud Platform project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API, and Geocoding API.
# 3. Create an API key and restrict it by HTTP referrer (e.g. http://localhost:5173/*) and APIs.
# 4. Copy this file to .env and set your key below:

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
